<title>USA: Fed confirms buying coupons.</title>
<headline>Fed confirms buying coupons.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve confirmed on Thursday said that it was buying coupons, which add permanent reserves to the banking system.</p>
<p>The operation comes just a half hour after the Fed injected temporary resrves via a round of overnight system repurchase agreements, which totaled $2.1 billion.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1867 ))</p>
